cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use R006, cite this repository/release and the upstream matrix-multiplication sources listed in the manuscript."
title: "Exact local obstructions around rank-47 4x4 matrix-multiplication schemes"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Unsolved Labs"
version: "R006"
date-released: 2026-08-14
url: "https://github.com/unsolved-labs/matmul-rank47-local-obstructions"
repository-code: "https://github.com/unsolved-labs/matmul-rank47-local-obstructions"
abstract: >-
  Exact proof-carrying computational certificates excluding coefficient-wise
  Z/4Z lifts and F3 coefficient assignments within factor-entry support
  distance two of two frozen rank-47 decompositions of the 4x4
  matrix-multiplication tensor over F2. These are local representation-specific
  obstructions and do not prove a global rank-48 lower bound.
keywords:
  - matrix multiplication
  - tensor rank
  - computer-assisted proof
  - finite fields
  - exact verification
